      "id": "vhnnat7",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "7.1 Meaning of Computer Software"
    },
    {
      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "Computer software is broadly divided into System Software, Application Software, and Utility Software.",
        "System Software controls hardware operations and creates an execution platform for application software.",
        "Application Software is designed to complete end-user specific tasks like word processing and calculations.",
        "Utility Software performs supportive tasks including system optimization, antivirus scanning, and disk management."
      ],
      "id": "t2k1lp0"
    },
